   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Brand Guidelines\n\nA complete editorial identity film: a geometric brand mark, a terracotta, graphite, stone and paper palette, a type specimen that types and deletes itself through eight styles, a layered collage of drawn object plates, and three flipping tiles that become the closing wordmark. Silent: sound is added by the host. The object photos are drawn with SVG by default; pass image paths to use real photographs.\n\nCategory: templates. Length: 17.867 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- You want to introduce a brand system through its mark, colors, typography, and photography.\n- You need a complete 17.9-second identity film with editable content and a layered object collage.\n\nAvoid when:\n- You need a multi-feature software demo rather than an identity film: use launch-anything.\n- You only need a short typed title with an exit: use typed-split-wipe.\n\nVariables:\n- brand_name (string): Brand name, default \"Form Study\"\n- opening_tagline (string): Opening tagline, default \"Made with purpose.\"\n- guidelines_label (string): Guidelines label, default \"Brand guidelines\"\n- collage_title (string): Collage title, default \"Objects for everyday living.\"\n- collection_label (string): Collection label, default \"Material studies / No. 01\"\n- footer (string): Footer, default \"A fictional identity. Made to be yours.\"\n- phrase_1 (string): Phrase 1, default \"Material matters.\"\n- phrase_2 (string): Phrase 2, default \"Keep it simple.\"\n- phrase_3 (string): Phrase 3, default \"Find your form.\"\n- phrase_4 (string): Phrase 4, default \"Quiet by design.\"\n- phrase_5 (string): Phrase 5, default \"Make space.\"\n- phrase_6 (string): Phrase 6, default \"Feel the texture.\"\n- phrase_7 (string): Phrase 7, default \"Shape the everyday.\"\n- phrase_8 (string): Phrase 8, default \"Made with purpose.\"\n- closing_word_1 (string): Closing word 1, default \"Make\"\n- closing_word_2 (string): Closing word 2, default \"Ideas\"\n- closing_word_3 (string): Closing word 3, default \"Real.\"\n- accent_color (color): Accent, default \"#A64B38\"\n- ink (color): Ink, default \"#242321\"\n- stone (color): Stone, default \"#D6CFC4\"\n- paper (color): Paper, default \"#F5F1E9\"\n- logo_src (string): Logo image, default \"\"\n- photo_ceramics (string): Ceramics photo, default \"\"\n- photo_materials (string): Materials photo, default \"\"\n- photo_chair (string): Chair photo, default \"\"\n- reduced_motion (boolean): Reduced motion, default false\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
