lockup.\", \"default\": \"Form Study\"},\n    {\"id\": \"opening_tagline\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Opening tagline\", \"description\": \"Line under the mark in the first scene; also on the type plate.\", \"default\": \"Made with purpose.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"guidelines_label\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Guidelines label\", \"description\": \"Small caption above the type specimen.\", \"default\": \"Brand guidelines\"},\n    {\"id\": \"collage_title\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Collage title\", \"description\": \"Headline on the accent poster in the collage.\", \"default\": \"Objects for everyday living.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"collection_label\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Collection label\", \"description\": \"Small label on the accent poster.\", \"default\": \"Material studies / No. 01\"},\n    {\"id\": \"footer\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Footer\", \"description\": \"Fine print at the foot of the closing scene.\", \"default\": \"A fictional identity. Made to be yours.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"phrase_1\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Phrase 1\", \"description\": \"Type specimen text. Phrases 1 and 2 type in; 3 to 8 are quick style cuts.\", \"default\": \"Material matters.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"phrase_2\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Phrase 2\", \"description\": \"Type specimen text. Phrases 1 and 2 type in; 3 to 8 are quick style cuts.\", \"default\": \"Keep it simple.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"phrase_3\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Phrase 3\", \"description\": \"Type specimen text. Phrases 1 and 2 type in; 3 to 8 are quick style cuts.\", \"default\": \"Find your form.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"phrase_4\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Phrase 4\", \"description\": \"Type specimen text. Phrases 1 and 2 type in; 3 to 8 are quick style cuts.\", \"default\": \"Quiet by design.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"phrase_5\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Phrase 5\", \"description\": \"Type specimen text. Phrases 1 and 2 type in; 3 to 8 are quick style cuts.\", \"default\": \"Make space.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"phrase_6\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Phrase 6\", \"description\": \"Type specimen text. Phrases 1 and 2 type in; 3 to 8 are quick style cuts.\", \"default\": \"Feel the texture.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"phrase_7\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Phrase 7\", \"description\": \"Type specimen text. Phrases 1 and 2 type in; 3 to 8 are quick style cuts.\", \"default\": \"Shape the everyday.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"phrase_8\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Phrase 8\", \"description\": \"Type specimen text. Phrases 1 and 2 type in; 3 to 8 are quick style cuts. The last one stays under the collage.\", \"default\": \"Made with purpose.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"closing_word_1\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Closing word 1\", \"description\": \"Word on one of the three flipping tiles.\", \"default\": \"Make\"},\n    {\"id\": \"closing_word_2\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Closing word 2\", \"description\": \"Word on one of the three flipping tiles.\", \"default\": \"Ideas\"},\n    {\"id\": \"closing_word_3\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Closing word 3\", \"description\": \"Word on one of the three flipping tiles.\", \"default\": \"Real.\"},\n    {\"id\": \"accent_color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Accent\", \"description\": \"Mark, palette panel, active typography and the poster.\", \"default\": \"#A64B38\"},\n    {\"id\": \"ink\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Ink\", \"description\": \"Dark color: text and the palette and closing backgrounds.\", \"default\": \"#242321\"},\n    {\"id\": \"stone\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Stone\", \"description\": \"Light neutral: hairlines, plates and fine print.\", \"default\": \"#D6CFC4\"},\n    {\"id\": \"paper\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Paper\", \"description\": \"Light background.\", \"default\": \"#F5F1E9\"},\n    {\"id\": \"logo_src\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Logo image\", \"description\": \"Optional path to a transparent mark (PNG or SVG) your host provides; the drawn mark is used when empty.\", \"default\": \"\"},\n    {\"id\": \"photo_ceramics\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Ceramics photo\", \"description\": \"Optional path to a photo for the ceramics plates; a drawn still life is used when empty.\", \"default\": \"\"},\n    {\"id\": \"photo_materials\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Materials photo\", \"description\": \"Optional path to a photo for the materials plates; drawn swatches are used when empty.\", \"default\": \"\"},\n    {\"id\": \"photo_chair\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Chair photo\", \"description\": \"Optional path to a photo for the chair plates; a drawn chair is used when empty.\", \"default\": \"\"},\n    {\"id\": \"reduced_motion\", \"type\": \"boolean\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Reduced motion\", \"description\": \"Static layouts without typing, collage travel or tile flips.\", \"default\": false}\n  ]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Brand Guidelines</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;800&amp;family=Inter:ital,wght@0,400;1,300;1,500&amp;display=block\" />\n      <style>\n        #root { position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; container-type: size; pointer-events: none; background: var(--bgl-paper, #F5F1E9); color: var(--bgl-ink, #242321); font-family: Manrope, system-ui, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n        .bgl-stage { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 960px; height: 540px; transform-origin: 0 0; }\n        .bgl-scene { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 960px; height: 540px; display: none; }\n        .bgl-bg { position: absolute; left: 0; width: 960px; top: -3000px; height: 6540px; }\n        .bgl-abs { position: absolute; }\n        .bgl-label { font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.25; white-space: nowrap; }\n        .bgl-mark { display: block; }\n        .bgl-mark-img { background-size: contain; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center; }\n        .bgl-plate { position: absolute; top: 0; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.07); }\n        .bgl-fill { position: absolute; inset: 0; }\n        .bgl-photo { position: absolute; inset: 0; background-size: cover; background-position: center; }\n        .bgl-photo svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }\n        .bgl-spec { display: flex; align-items: center; letter-spacing: -0.055em; line-height: 1.1; white-space: nowrap; }\n        .bgl-caret { display: inline-block; width: 3px; height: 88px; margin-left: 5px; }\n        .bgl-tile { text-align: center; perspective: 600px; }\n        .bgl-tile-text { font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.05em; line-height: 1.2; }\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"brand-guidelines\" data-duration=\"17.867\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"bgl-clip\" class=\"clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"17.867\" data-track-index=\"0\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0\">\n          <div id=\"bgl-stage\" class=\"bgl-stage\">\n            <div id=\"bgl-s-identity\" class=\"bgl-scene\"></div>\n            <div id=\"bgl-s-palette\" class=\"bgl-scene\"></div>\n            <div id=\"bgl-s-type\" class=\"bgl-scene\"></div>\n            <div id=\"bgl-s-collage\" class=\"bgl-scene\"></div>\n            <div id=\"bgl-s-closing\" class=\"bgl-scene\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars = window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables() : {};\n            function clamp01(v) { return Math.max(0, Math.min(1, v)); }\n            function bezier(x1, y1, x2, y2) {\n              return function (x) {\n                if (x <= 0) return 0;\n                if (x >= 1) return 1;\n                var lo = 0, hi = 1, t = x;\n                for (var k = 0; k < 30; k++) {\n                  var mt = 1 - t;\n                  var bx = 3 * mt * mt * t * x1 + 3 * mt * t * t * x2 + t * t * t;\n                  if (bx < x) lo = t; else hi = t;\n                  t = (lo + hi) / 2;\n                }\n                var m = 1 - t;\n                return 3 * m * m * t * y1 + 3 * m * t * t * y2 + t * t * t;\n              };\n            }\n            function progress(f, a, b) { return clamp01((f - a) / (b - a)); }\n            function lerp(a, b, t) { return a + (b - a) * t; }\n            // interpolate(frame, [a, b], [from, to]) with an optional easing and clamped ends.\n            function interp(f, a, b, from, to, easing) {\n              var t = progress(f, a, b);\n              return lerp(from, to, easing ? easing(t) : t);\n            }\n            function num(value, fallback, min, max) {\n              var n = Number(value);\n              return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(max, Math.max(min, n)) : fallback;\n            }\n            function str(value, fallback) {\n              return typeof value === \"string\" && value.trim() ? value.trim() : fallback;\n            }\n            function graphemes(text) {\n              if (typeof Intl !== \"undefined\" && Intl.Segmenter) {\n                return Array.from(new Intl.Segmenter(\"en\", { granularity: \"grapheme\" }).segment(text), function (p) { return p.segment; });\n              }\n              return Array.from(text);\n            }\n\n            var T = {\n              accent: str(vars.accent_color, \"#A64B38\"), ink: str(vars.ink, \"#242321\"),\n              stone: str(vars.stone, \"#D6CFC4\"), paper: str(vars.paper, \"#F5F1E9\")\n            };\n            var C = {\n              brand: str(vars.brand_name, \"Form Study\"), tagline: str(vars.opening_tagline, \"Made with purpose.\"),\n              label: str(vars.guidelines_label, \"Brand guidelines\"), collageTitle: str(vars.collage_title, \"Objects for everyday living.\"),\n              collection: str(vars.collection_label, \"Material studies / No. 01\"), footer: str(vars.footer, \"A fictional identity. Made to be yours.\")\n            };\n            var PHRASE_DEFAULTS = [\"Material matters.\", \"Keep it simple.\", \"Find your form.\", \"Quiet by design.\", \"Make space.\", \"Feel the texture.\", \"Shape the everyday.\", \"Made with purpose.\"];\n            var phrases = PHRASE_DEFAULTS.map(function (d, i) { return str(vars[\"phrase_\" + (i + 1)], d); });\n            var WORD_DEFAULTS = [\"Make\", \"Ideas\", \"Real.\"];\n            var words = WORD_DEFAULTS.map(function (d, i) { return str(vars[\"closing_word_\" + (i + 1)], d); });\n            var logoSrc = typeof vars.logo_src === \"string\" ? vars.logo_src.trim() : \"\";\n            var reduced = vars.reduced_motion === true || vars.reduced_motion === \"true\";\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--bgl-paper\", T.paper);\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--bgl-ink\", T.ink);\n            document.getElementById(\"bgl-clip\").style.background = T.paper;\n\n            // Design space 960x540, contained in the frame and centred; scene backgrounds\n            // reach past it vertically so a portrait frame is filled.\n            var CW = root.clientWidth || 1080, CH = root.clientHeight || 1920;\n            var S = Math.min(CW / 960, CH / 540);\n            var stage = document.getElementById(\"bgl-stage\");\n            stage.style.left = (CW - 960 * S) / 2 + \"px\";\n            stage.style.top = (CH - 540 * S) / 2 + \"px\";\n            stage.style.transform = \"scale(\" + S + \")\";\n\n            var slideEase = bezier(0.65, 0, 0.25, 1);\n            function slide(f, a, b) { return slideEase(progress(f, a, b)); }\n            function fitSize(text, max, width) {\n              var units = graphemes(text).reduce(function (sum, ch) {\n                if (/\\s/.test(ch)) return sum + 0.29;\n                if (/[ilI.,'!|]/.test(ch)) return sum + 0.29;\n                if (/[MW@%]/.test(ch)) return sum + 0.96;\n                if ((ch.codePointAt(0) || 0) > 0x024f) return sum + 1;\n                return sum + 0.62;\n              }, 0);\n              return Math.min(max, width / Math.max(1, units));\n            }\n            function el(parent, css, cls, text) {\n              var d = document.createElement(\"div\");\n              if (cls) d.className = cls;\n              if (css) d.style.cssText = css;\n              if (text != null) d.textContent = text;\n              if (parent) parent.appendChild(d);\n              return d;\n            }\n            function bgOf(parent, color) { var b = el(parent, \"background:\" + color, \"bgl-bg\"); return b; }\n            function mark(parent, color, size, css) {\n              var wrap = el(parent, \"width:\" + size + \"px;height:\" + size + \"px;\" + (css || \"\"), \"bgl-abs\");\n              if (logoSrc) {\n                var im = el(wrap, \"width:100%;height:100%;background-image:url('\" + logoSrc.replace(/'/g, \"%27\") + \"')\", \"bgl-mark-img\");\n                return { wrap: wrap, paint: function () {} };\n              }\n              wrap.innerHTML = '<svg class=\"bgl-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" width=\"' + size + '\" height=\"' + size + '\" fill=\"' + color + '\" role=\"img\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"7\" width=\"25\" height=\"86\"/><path d=\"M42 7h49v9c0 18-14 32-32 32H42Z\"/><path d=\"M42 56h36v5c0 17-13 30-30 30h-6Z\"/></svg>';\n              return { wrap: wrap };\n            }\n            function label(parent, css, text) { return el(parent, css, \"bgl-label\", text); }\n\n            // ---- Scene: identity\n            var sId = document.getElementById(\"bgl-s-identity\");\n            bgOf(sId, T.paper);\n            mark(sId, T.accent, 104, \"left:428px;top:185px\");\n            var idTag = el(sId, \"top:321px;left:100px;width:760px;text-align:center;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-size:\" + fitSize(C.tagline, 32, 760) + \"px\", \"bgl-abs\", C.tagline);\n\n            // ---- Scene: palette\n            var sPal = document.getElementById(\"bgl-s-palette\");\n            bgOf(sPal, T.ink);\n            var palLabelInk = label(sPal, \"top:258px;color:\" + T.paper + \";font-size:16px\", T.ink.toUpperCase());\n            palLabelInk.className += \" bgl-abs\"; palLabelInk.style.position = \"absolute\";\n            var panels = [[T.accent, T.paper], [T.stone, T.ink], [T.paper, T.ink]].map(function (p) {\n              var pan = el(sPal, \"top:-3000px;height:6540px;width:960px;background:\" + p[0] + \";color:\" + p[1], \"bgl-abs\");\n              var lb = label(pan, \"position:absolute;left:16px;top:3258px;font-size:16px\", p[0].toUpperCase());\n              return pan;\n            });\n\n            // ---- Scene: type specimen\n            var sTy = document.getElementById(\"bgl-s-type\");\n            bgOf(sTy, T.paper);\n            var guides = el(sTy, \"inset:0\", \"bgl-abs\");\n            var gl = label(guides, \"top:195px;width:100%;text-align:center\", C.label); gl.style.position = \"absolute\";\n            [226, 268, 310].forEach(function (y) { el(guides, \"left:48px;right:48px;top:\" + y + \"px;height:1px;back